<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Arnotts sells macadamia operations.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Arnotts sells macadamia operations.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biscuit maker Arnotts Ltd said on Wednesday that it has sold its Australian macadamia operations to Australian Macfarms Pty Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Arnotts is about 70 percent owned by Campbell Soup Co of the United States.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
